"Any person otherwise required to register for VAT purposes who fails register shall be liable to VAT on his sale of taxable goods or properties . . . The sale and importation of goods subject to excise taxes imposed under Title VI of the Code are also subject to VAT, except coal and natural gas in whatever form or state, and manufactured petroleum products (other than lubricating oil, processed gas, grease, wax and petroleum).

